- prefillFromAgent() now populates sursalaire, indemnite_logement,
  indemnite_transport, indemnite_fonction from agent record when
  selecting an agent in the bulletin creation form

- Added drawBulletinOnDoc() helper (reuses same layout as
  generateBulletinPDF but writes into an existing jsPDF instance)

- Added generateBulletinsGroupesPDF(): selects active agents
  (statut='Actif', type_contrat NOT IN VDP/Stagiaire,
  date_embauche ≤ first day of selected month), computes payroll
  from each agent's stored salary/indemnités, and produces a
  single multi-page PDF (one page per agent)

- Added "Générer tous les bulletins" button in the period header
  with live progress indicator (current/total — agent name)

