Subject: [PATCH 05/13] fix(import): use header:1 + manual mapping to handle
 merged cells in Excel

Replace sheet_to_json with range option by reading raw arrays (header:1),
extracting row 3 as headers and rows 4+ as data, then building objects
manually. This avoids __EMPTY keys caused by merged cells in column A.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017HxqhKNkFmFwfrSg5d33kd
---
