Subject: [PATCH 08/13] =?UTF-8?q?feat(paie):=20G=C3=A9n=C3=A9rer=20et=20en?=
 =?UTF-8?q?registrer=20tous=20les=20bulletins=20en=20un=20clic?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
